{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Takes no address. The server reads it off the caller’s own record, and this signature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deliberately offers no way to name a different one: a parameter here would let an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authenticated session mail an arbitrary address."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" this reports the outcome, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"caller is signed in to the account it is asking about and none of the outcomes tells","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it anything it did not already bring with it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"returns — a token was minted and the mail ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"enqueued","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Delivery is asynchronous","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and can still fail at the provider; a queue that accepts everything in front of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider that rejects it looks exactly like this succeeding (§25.7 rule 3).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.authz","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (from "},{"code":"409","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") — already verified, or an account state that must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not be sent a live token."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.network","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"429","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — the daily resend limit.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"§25.7 rule 2 forbids falling back to the unauthenticated endpoint on either failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and this SDK does not: that fallback turns both back into a silent success and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"restores the bug this operation exists to fix, with an extra round trip.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Refused client-side with ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no wire call"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" when there is no session.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC21resendOwnVerificationyyYaKF","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"title":"resendOwnVerification()","symbolKind":"method"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"signed-in caller’s own"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()"]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md)."}],"title":"AxiamClient","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendverification(email:tenantid:)","abstract":[{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/resend-verification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1) — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"unauthenticated","type":"text"}]},{"text":" resend, for a caller with no session.","type":"text"}],"title":"resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendOwnVerification()":{"title":"resendOwnVerification()","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"signed-in caller’s own"}]},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()"}}}